Code
- Ledger card, caption slam, counter and source-tag techniques adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library's caption-news demo (MIT, github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar)
- Rendering and mastering tools from the same library (MIT)

Picture and sound
- Graphics only: no footage or photographs.
- Original score and foley synthesised in mix.py (numpy/scipy). No samples, no voice.

Facts
- All figures from Gwangmyeong City's announcement as reported 2026-10-28 (see FACTS.md).
- "초록브리핑 / GREEN BRIEF" is a fictional channel. No logo of the city or the arboretum is used.
